<BaseLayout title={pageTitle('State-Regulated Life Insurance: The Government Benefit Hoax (Preview)')} description="Preview draft: what state-regulated life insurance mailers really are, what regulators found, and what happens when you send the card back." robots="noindex, nofollow" noindex>
